{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3c9d5f356f06a3ec005ea80cc1f170b7f72d6e64eaf14fd3b5af2603e9d9b153", "ja": "配信番組も終盤を迎え、ここでゲストが登場！\nドラマに出演した翼、麗花を混じえて、\n登場人物についてのエピソードや、\n撮影の裏話で盛り上がる一同。", "zh": "直播节目渐入尾声，这时嘉宾登场！让出演过电视剧的翼和丽花也加入其中，大家围绕剧中人物的趣闻以及拍摄花絮聊得热火朝天。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_03_1002_015siz", "source_sha256": "62b4b9bde669020303f6b70b68d17c7f7073b976f08151a5aa440cf6548968dd", "ja": "ここからは、ゲストの方々と一緒にお届けします。\nドラマ『天国の鳥』で共演した……。", "zh": "接下来将和各位嘉宾一起为大家带来节目。\n曾在电视剧《天国之鸟》中共同出演的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_03_1003_048rei", "source_sha256": "191f5ef98d0f22d4fa9c8981a5153421d8b3fc03aacaa6b6d811b083508bcac4", "ja": "はーい！\n北上麗花さんでーす、パチパチパチ～♪", "zh": "嗨——！\n北上丽花小姐登场啦，啪啪啪啪～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_03_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b6f3a593dec5a8bec8f00919e66ae438534ac591a3137e64fd9f9b3f226cb81b", "ja": "あれ～？　麗花さん、もう出ていいんですか？\nあっ。伊吹翼でーす！　えへへっ♪", "zh": "咦～？丽花前辈，已经可以出场了吗？\n啊，我是伊吹翼！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_03_1005_050jul", "source_sha256": "2faee3ad07e659808b4482aa7a835766aff0fc21e44a8ede9b1363fe43ae7290", "ja": "はあ……。\nこりゃ、先が思いやられるな……。", "zh": "唉……。\n这下可真让人担心接下来的发展啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_03_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "55c815b4f134f34d0220e456e96a865ce840d17095fa67b57e197d9d213c33b3", "ja": "えーっと、静香の友人・翼役の伊吹翼さんと、\nジュリアのマネージャー・麗花役の北上麗花さんです！", "zh": "那个……饰演静香的朋友翼的伊吹翼小姐，以及饰演茱莉亚的经纪人丽花的北上丽花小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_03_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d3224c44ed4c77740d76fe2d5d764f6bd9299c14e09e8397d10633efdbc44fbb", "ja": "よろしくお願いしまーす♪", "zh": "请多关照～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_03_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "058865d01a01b4a41ff516744138e8238464a45660a0e6a245eb7a86a8b95e65", "ja": "よろしくお願いしまーす！", "zh": "请多多指教──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_03_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "508b92fabbe00a89d60a2ebfa4cc5114f6e7a775a13c56b2dc1587c3fbe53143", "ja": "ふたりが演じる翼と麗花は、\nそれぞれが静香とジュリアを支えてきた人物なんだ。", "zh": "两人所饰演的翼和丽花，分别是一直支持着静香和茱莉亚的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_03_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "c2e526fbc72490adf110d01503dfda84a5fc8dcc6b050d709f8fbb778029a239", "ja": "はい。静香と翼は高校からの友人で、\n撮影でも一緒にいる時間が多かったんです。", "zh": "是的。静香和翼从高中起就是朋友，拍摄时也经常待在一起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_03_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c6b32bc9b06295a86cd05c223dd17ecff889212c9748155c969f39da10c3dceb", "ja": "そうそう。ホントの友達みたいだったよねー！\nだから撮影の時も、すっごく楽しかったよ！", "zh": "对对，简直就像真正的朋友一样呢——！所以拍摄的时候也特别开心哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_03_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "3a63624f7db6a5398f2b232118c75960118eb7ef225fc75223d1ee4ccd065d85", "ja": "ホントの友達って……私と翼だって友達でしょ？", "zh": "真正的朋友……我和翼不也是朋友吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_03_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e85a9fa35bb4622ec78f50436e16e53271e1b397be8a42ed97d6c0a6b31fcd59", "ja": "うん、そうだよ。でも、静香ちゃんは真面目だな～。\n私だったら、そんなこと恥ずかしくて言えないかも。", "zh": "嗯，是啊。不过，静香真是一本正经啊～。\n换作是我，可能会因为害羞而说不出这种话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_03_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "52562f37f41653f084ce2a34da70312c9f8c695bd7badf64e49c130d9c920cca", "ja": "えっ！　つ、翼～！", "zh": "诶！翼——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_03_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "e8a4396267c7fd8e848c1f7c04c20c7ebb00c706052f7d493e784a918c24428c", "ja": "そういや、コンクールの撮影もこんな感じだったよな。\nガチガチに緊張したシズに、翼が話しかけててさ。", "zh": "说起来，比赛拍摄时也是这种感觉吧。\n静紧张得浑身僵硬，翼还主动跟她搭话来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_03_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "3d62b48ae757c48d7227942d0e68dae52689d235d756535111eb45b2d0be8faa", "ja": "はい。私がピアノを演奏するシーンだったので、\nすごい緊張してたんです。でも翼の話が止まらなくて。", "zh": "是的，因为是我演奏钢琴的场景，所以当时特别紧张。不过翼一直说个不停。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_03_1017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2411fd0cc36c0e1fed81dd93aaca5841b373e9d956f4629774961b7921ae470f", "ja": "だってぇ、ドラマの待ち時間ってつまんないんだもん。\nあの時は静香ちゃんしか、話し相手いなかったし。", "zh": "可是嘛，拍电视剧的等待时间很无聊啊。\n那时候只有静香能陪我聊天。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_03_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "a61f8aa19ee9909140de9b2155be572ed6b56279920d85391ccefe0f2bf5b36d", "ja": "もう、私を巻き込まないの。でも翼と話したからかな。\nその後の演奏は上手く弾けたと思う。", "zh": "真是的，别再把我卷进去了。不过，也许是因为和翼聊过吧。之后的演奏，我觉得自己弹得挺好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_03_1019_050jul", "source_sha256": "11f4e77bb14acb992a5a5c5b639dae215073bb450020ba027d65e792e526d0b2", "ja": "なるほど。それで、一発OKだったのか。", "zh": "原来如此。所以才会一次通过吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_03_1020_015siz", "source_sha256": "c26cbad46e9f7dd916b63ede90a1e377c673b97d43633800456eb33704b9c021", "ja": "私達もですけど、ジュリアさんと麗花さんも、\n一緒にいるシーンが多かったですよね？", "zh": "我们也是，不过，茱莉亚先生和丽花小姐也经常有一起行动的场景，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_03_1021_050jul", "source_sha256": "49f22abef1806872914509f7a714e45e041113eaa6a2b9cbdcfa9431e9514ff3", "ja": "ああ。麗花は、すごく頼りになるマネージャーなんだ。\nイギリスでの苦楽を共有してきた戦友ってとこかな。", "zh": "啊。丽花是个非常可靠的经理。算是一起在英国同甘共苦过的战友吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_03_1022_048rei", "source_sha256": "fbc4d323087c82c701771523e988f81ab6940fd2e4ca1473c12dd01e6df874c6", "ja": "うんうん！　オテンバなジュリアちゃんと一緒に、\n営業したり、音楽のお悩み相談もしたりして……。", "zh": "嗯嗯！和淘气的茱莉亚一起，做宣传，还帮忙解答音乐方面的烦恼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_03_1023_048rei", "source_sha256": "f90774f8133eeba398dfbd7e8cbf8f99575047556612649ab022ea1e644c0168", "ja": "いーっぱいジュリアちゃんのこと、支えたよ！\nだって、敏腕マネージャーだもん！　えっへん♪", "zh": "我一直都在全力支持茱莉亚！  \n我可是能干的经纪人！哼哼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_03_1024_050jul", "source_sha256": "bd29af7e6ec6ae8dd13d4eb893361ff2d42d724d60a473c479f97927a243a684", "ja": "ん？　それって、役の話だよな？", "zh": "嗯？你说的是角色设定吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_03_1025_048rei", "source_sha256": "7feb5a134b83efc49d0fb6d0a35c0b6bbdbbbd8be3ccbe1456caeaf447ace8d6", "ja": "そうだよ♪　空を見上げて困ってるジュリアちゃんを、\n多分、放っておけなかったんじゃないかな。", "zh": "就是这样♪大概是没法放着那个抬头望着天空、显得很困扰的茱莉亚不管吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_03_1026_050jul", "source_sha256": "b796c5d58b6671b06b7f6d78235a8b064e3975e29e3afbb2af745a987195c31d", "ja": "空を見上げてか。その表現、いいな！\nジュリアと麗花、お互いに相性が良かったのかもな。", "zh": "说是仰望天空啊。这个说法不错！\n茱莉亚和丽花，说不定彼此很合得来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_03_1027_015siz", "source_sha256": "982fd44b199105a5944f90f186da2d6e9707bde0dd57c71bab6caa40e8acfd8b", "ja": "ふたりの絆がわかるシーンは、何度もありましたけど、\nジュリアに寄り添う麗花の姿が、すごく印象的でした。", "zh": "虽然有很多次都展现了两人的羁绊，但丽花陪伴在茱莉亚身边的样子，给我留下了非常深刻的印象。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_03_1028_016tsu", "source_sha256": "687dab11088225b1361e80ce17ac4bdeb298efa2a9e23585f377d8fef2233e86", "ja": "うんうん。なんだかジュリアーノのお姉さんみたい！\nオトナの関係って感じでよかったよね！", "zh": "嗯嗯。总觉得像是茱莉亚诺的姐姐一样！感觉就是成熟的大人关系，真不错呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_03_1029_050jul", "source_sha256": "1c65457b547da72580ef64d90be2d2088279ec6bc825090852e6b392e3e92b37", "ja": "そう見えたなら、よかった。まあ、レイの方が年上\nだしな。それに、どこかで頼ってたとこもあったし。", "zh": "如果看起来是那样，那就好。毕竟丽花比我年长嘛。而且，我也有在某些地方依赖她。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_03_1030_048rei", "source_sha256": "4b7e749e01f527c5779cf53c088e7bc1518f557691323c495a9497055a7d578c", "ja": "そうなんだ～。私も、ジュリアちゃん頑張れー！って、\n応援してたから、なんか一緒だね♪", "zh": "原来是这样～我也一直在给茱莉亚加油，所以感觉我们一样呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_03_1031_050jul", "source_sha256": "643c6867cc28c4655bc1150063352e8461692297aa1d01b5aa7a0c7b7ad4eddd", "ja": "えっ、応援してたのか？　全然気づかなかった……。", "zh": "诶，你之前给我加油了吗？我完全没注意到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_03_1032_048rei", "source_sha256": "4b4f2dd4c2d3a01c27ee2088e503aff9f93a1fadaf81404f4b3048efbf108f90", "ja": "うん！　心の中でね！", "zh": "嗯！在心里给你加油呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_03_1033_050jul", "source_sha256": "d765d0b0dc82b10497b6fb61925dea579a3f4efd45bef8d5c36e8f11627663b8", "ja": "心の中かよっ！", "zh": "只是在心里啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0158_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0158_story_03_1034_015siz", "source_sha256": "7566c057bb9d9df9558b557477dc3ade6b3ab093d511fd75612b09321954e886", "ja": "えっと、話が盛り上がってますが……\nここで一度、CMです！", "zh": "那个，聊得正热闹呢……\n现在先插播一段广告！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
